2026-09-26 22:45:28,338 INFO sqlalchemy.engine.Engine [cached since 0.1162s ago] ('97eb5282-d035-443a-ab1c-cfcc9725e9c8', '0d62002b-893c-44e3-8285-fb63d2cc1b7e', '47b58c4a-fd56-4464-8b82-b43597d3fbb8', '16d55ae7-b65b-460b-9df8-8f6d49e5156b', None, 9, '2026-11-21', 1, 9, 0, 8, '2026-09-14', 1, '', 'Nursery 1', 'Numeracy', 11, 60, '', 'WAPEF Acceptance Teacher', 'Number', 'Scribbling', '', '', '[]', '[]', 'Number - Scribbling', "Learners' everyday experience related to this activity.", '[{"id": "e51f108c-0843-4292-aef1-af090db5de6d", "description": "Learners can show and talk about Scribbling", "indicator_code": null, "source": "deterministic"}]', 'Learners will recognize and appreciate the beauty, order, and purpose of design in the physical world around them.', 'Shaping our world.', '["God worshiper", "Image reflector"]', 'Redemption', '', '[]', '["flash cards", "Counters", "sticks"]', '[]', '["flash cards", "Counters", "sticks"]', 'This lesson focuses on Scribbling within Number - Scribbling.', 'Gather the children with a familiar song or rhyme, then show the real objects or pictures for Scribbling and let them touch and talk about them.', '[{"id": "236401a0-82dc-4240-ab92-10665ecb8832", "phase": "TEACHER MODELLING", "description": "Model Scribbling slowly with real objects while the chi ... (540 characters truncated) ... ng, matching, singing or colouring \\u2014 while you watch and encourage them.", "duration_minutes": 12, "resources": [], "source": "deterministic"}]', '[{"id": "029a25ac-51ea-4c75-82c7-d4c38dd7fa5c", "phase": "LEARNER", "description": "Watch and listen carefully, then describe each step of Scribbling ... (404 characters truncated) ... "description": "Join in the play or song about Scribbling and try it yourself.", "duration_minutes": 12, "resources": [], "source": "deterministic"}]', '[{"id": "c3ec7d3a-68ba-4c13-b7e3-ab0b49f02e0c", "phase": "TEACHER", "description": "Model Scribbling slowly, think aloud, and check that all learners ... (444 characters truncated) ...  as they play at Scribbling, encourage them by name and praise their attempts.", "duration_minutes": 12, "resources": [], "source": "deterministic"}]', 'Watch each child during the activity and ask simple oral questions — point to, name or show Scribbling. Tick who can do it and who needs more help; t ... (4 characters truncated) ...  is no written test. Assessment mode: Oral questions and observation of participation. Evidence: each child shows or names one example of Scribbling.', 'Bring the children back to the circle, sing or clap about Scribbling, let a few children show what they made or did, and praise each child.', '[]', '[]', '[]', '', 'Support: Sit beside the child, guide the hand or the answer for Scribbling, and use bigger, simpler objects until the child succeeds.\nExtension: Let ... (10 characters truncated) ... who finish early do Scribbling again with more objects or show a friend how it is done.\nGrouping: Whole-class circle time, then small guided groups.', '[]', 'generated', 0, 0, '{}', '2026-09-26 22:45:28.337433', '2026-09-26 22:45:28.337441')
