, encourage them by name and praise their attempts.", "duration_minutes": 12, "resources": [], "source": "deterministic"}]', 'Watch each child during the activity and ask simple oral questions — point to, name or show Writing numbers from 0 – 2. Tick who can do it and who ne ... (36 characters truncated) ... est. Assessment mode: Oral questions and observation of participation. Evidence: each child shows or names one example of Writing numbers from 0 – 2.', 'Bring the children back to the circle, sing or clap about Writing numbers from 0 – 2, let a few children show what they made or did, and praise each child.', '[]', '[]', '["writing", "numbers"]', '', 'Support: Sit beside the child, guide the hand or the answer for Writing numbers from 0 – 2, and use bigger, simpler objects until the child succeeds. ... (42 characters truncated) ...  do Writing numbers from 0 – 2 again with more objects or show a friend how it is done.\nGrouping: Whole-class circle time, then small guided groups.', '[]', 'generated', 0, 0, '{}', '2026-09-26 22:45:28.380706', '2026-09-26 22:45:28.380714')
