2026-09-26 22:45:38,010 INFO sqlalchemy.engine.Engine [cached since 9.789s ago] ('0195e8b7-968b-4ad4-90c9-ba0976751fc9', '89ee3e16-0250-4048-98d2-4fc1884da1ea', '47b58c4a-fd56-4464-8b82-b43597d3fbb8', 'e0b66506-026a-44e9-8dea-16b170af31df', None, 3, '2026-10-10', 1, 13, 1, 3, '2026-09-14', 2, '', 'KG 2', 'Numeracy', 11, 60, '', 'WAPEF Acceptance Teacher', 'All About Me', 'Personal Hygiene And Caring For The Parts Of The Body', 'K2.1.3.1', 'K2.1.3.1', '["K2.1.3.1.1 K2.1.3.1.1-7"]', '["K2.1.3.1.1"]', 'All About Me - Personal Hygiene And Caring For The Parts Of The Body', 'Previous lesson: The Parts Of The Human Body (Both External And Internal) And Their', '[{"id": "04383d5a-6c8d-4c6d-9436-61d57193ea1e", "description": "Learners can identify, talk about and act out Personal Hygiene And Caring For The Parts Of The Body", "indicator_code": "K2.1.3.1.1", "source": "deterministic"}]', 'Learners will recognize and appreciate the beauty, order, and purpose of design in the physical world around them.', 'Shaping our world.', '["God worshiper", "Image reflector"]', 'Creation', '', '[]', '["Poster/ cut out pictures depicting how to care for the parts body"]', '[]', '["Poster/ cut out pictures depicting how to care for the parts body"]', "This lesson builds on 'The Parts Of The Human Body (Both External And Internal) And Their' and moves the class on to Personal Hygiene And Caring For The Parts Of The Body.", "Build on the previous lesson ('The Parts Of The Human Body (Both External And Internal) And Their'). Begin with a short song, rhyme or movement activity linked to Personal Hygiene And Caring For The Parts Of The Body. Use concrete objects and picture cards to gain attention.", '[{"id": "30222488-5c65-4da8-a5c2-fd940b94465c", "phase": "TEACHER-LED ACTIVITY", "description": "Show and model Personal Hygiene And Caring For The P ... (634 characters truncated) ... Hygiene And Caring For The Parts Of The Body with the teacher\'s encouragement.", "duration_minutes": 8, "resources": [], "source": "deterministic"}]', '[{"id": "4e07afe9-aaf9-48ac-b4d6-3e7cf6b85e71", "phase": "LEARNER", "description": "Take an active part in the activity for Personal Hygiene And Cari ... (491 characters truncated) ... ng For The Parts Of The Body on your own and check your work before you finish.", "duration_minutes": 8, "resources": [], "source": "deterministic"}]', '[{"id": "7d97dd13-3800-4842-b107-c51458676689", "phase": "TEACHER", "description": "Facilitate the activity and keep every learner focused on Persona ... (556 characters truncated) ...  who need re-teaching of Personal Hygiene And Caring For The Parts Of The Body.", "duration_minutes": 8, "resources": [], "source": "deterministic"}]', 'Observe children during play and the individual try, using a simple checklist for Personal Hygiene And Caring For The Parts Of The Body. Note who needs more practice; there is no written test. Assessment mode: Oral questions and observation of participation.', "Gather the children, sing or clap about Personal Hygiene And Caring For The Parts Of The Body, and praise specific efforts. Pack away together. Preview the next lesson ('Keeping My Body Healthy And Eating Good Food And Taking My Vaccination').", '[]', '[]', '[]', '', 'Support: Give extra one-to-one help and larger, simpler materials so the child can try Personal Hygiene And Caring For The Parts Of The Body successf ... (70 characters truncated) ... r let them show a friend how to do Personal Hygiene And Caring For The Parts Of The Body.\nGrouping: Whole-group circle time, then small play groups.', '[]', 'generated', 0, 0, '{}', '2026-09-26 22:45:38.010051', '2026-09-26 22:45:38.010058')
