2026-09-26 22:45:38,022 INFO sqlalchemy.engine.Engine [cached since 9.801s ago] ('dbc79de3-8723-4b0e-a583-1d5d0bc84077', '89ee3e16-0250-4048-98d2-4fc1884da1ea', '47b58c4a-fd56-4464-8b82-b43597d3fbb8', 'e0b66506-026a-44e9-8dea-16b170af31df', None, 4, '2026-10-17', 1, 13, 1, 4, '2026-09-14', 3, '', 'KG 2', 'Numeracy', 11, 60, '', 'WAPEF Acceptance Teacher', 'All About Me', 'Keeping My Body Healthy And Eating Good Food And Taking My Vaccination', 'K2.1.4.1', 'K2.1.4.1', '["K2.1.4.1.1 K2.1.4.1.1-7"]', '["K2.1.4.1.1"]', 'All About Me - Keeping My Body Healthy And Eating Good Food And Taking My Vaccination', 'Previous lesson: Personal Hygiene And Caring For The Parts Of The Body', '[{"id": "33fbda2e-6885-4f57-ab33-8e086319d247", "description": "Learners can identify, talk about and act out Keeping My Body Healthy And Eating Good Food And Taking My Vaccination", "indicator_code": "K2.1.4.1.1", "source": "deterministic"}]', 'Learners will recognize and appreciate the beauty, order, and purpose of design in the physical world around them.', 'Shaping our world.', '["God worshiper", "Image reflector"]', 'Creation', '', '[]', '["Poster/ cut out picture depicting the healthy foods"]', '[]', '["Poster/ cut out picture depicting the healthy foods"]', "This lesson builds on 'Personal Hygiene And Caring For The Parts Of The Body' and moves the class on to Keeping My Body Healthy And Eating Good Food And Taking My Vaccination.", "Build on the previous lesson ('Personal Hygiene And Caring For The Parts Of The Body'). Begin with a short song, rhyme or movement activity linked to Keeping My Body Healthy And Eating Good Food And Taking My Vaccination. Use concrete objects and picture cards to gain attention.", '[{"id": "9648c644-61df-45de-9caf-bfa13a0bb10f", "phase": "TEACHER-LED ACTIVITY", "description": "Show and model Keeping My Body Healthy And Eating Go ... (685 characters truncated) ... d Eating Good Food And Taking My Vaccination with the teacher\'s encouragement.", "duration_minutes": 8, "resources": [], "source": "deterministic"}]', '[{"id": "8dcbfe6c-57e4-4879-8ded-4c43171537fd", "phase": "LEARNER", "description": "Take an active part in the activity for Keeping My Body Healthy A ... (542 characters truncated) ... od And Taking My Vaccination on your own and check your work before you finish.", "duration_minutes": 8, "resources": [], "source": "deterministic"}]', '[{"id": "60be3311-2dda-43f2-b1fa-fe33ae5f1ba6", "phase": "TEACHER", "description": "Facilitate the activity and keep every learner focused on Keeping ... (607 characters truncated) ... hing of Keeping My Body Healthy And Eating Good Food And Taking My Vaccination.", "duration_minutes": 8, "resources": [], "source": "deterministic"}]', 'Observe children during play and the individual try, using a simple checklist for Keeping My Body Healthy And Eating Good Food And Taking My Vaccination. Note who needs more practice; there is no written test. Assessment mode: Oral questions and observation of participation.', "Gather the children, sing or clap about Keeping My Body Healthy And Eating Good Food And Taking My Vaccination, and praise specific efforts. Pack away together. Preview the next lesson ('My Environment And My Health').", '[]', '[]', '[]', '', 'Support: Give extra one-to-one help and larger, simpler materials so the child can try Keeping My Body Healthy And Eating Good Food And Taking My Vac ... (104 characters truncated) ...  friend how to do Keeping My Body Healthy And Eating Good Food And Taking My Vaccination.\nGrouping: Whole-group circle time, then small play groups.', '[]', 'generated', 0, 0, '{}', '2026-09-26 22:45:38.022426', '2026-09-26 22:45:38.022432')
