2026-09-26 22:45:58,760 INFO sqlalchemy.engine.Engine [cached since 30.54s ago] ('15fa5e3d-d519-4c22-a25a-766360b70e32', '872f2e4e-81db-42f1-9b33-9c05745bb695', '5e8c37f9-61b5-4c17-a281-713c593f691b', '0947f94d-44b9-4b9f-88fa-2faea436f29a', None, 1, '2026-09-26', 1, 1, 0, 1, '2026-09-21', 1, '', 'KG 2', 'Numeracy', 11, 60, '', 'KG Acceptance Teacher', 'All About Me', 'I Am A Wonderful And Unique Creation', 'K2.1.1.1', 'K2.1.1.1', '["K2.1.1.1.1 K2.1.1.1.1-3"]', '["K2.1.1.1.1"]', 'All About Me - I Am A Wonderful And Unique Creation', "Learners' everyday experience related to this activity.", '[{"id": "ea695487-b4c8-4977-9f6c-26634613ed86", "description": "Learners can identify, talk about and act out I Am A Wonderful And Unique Creation", "indicator_code": "K2.1.1.1.1", "source": "deterministic"}]', 'Learners will recognize and appreciate the beauty, order, and purpose of design in the physical world around them.', 'Shaping our world.', '["God worshiper", "Image reflector"]', 'Creation', '', '[]', '["Poster/ cut out", "counters", "Cut out shapes", "crayons", "big books"]', '[]', '["Poster/ cut out", "counters", "Cut out shapes", "crayons", "big books"]', 'This lesson focuses on I Am A Wonderful And Unique Creation within All About Me - I Am A Wonderful And Unique Creation.', 'Begin with a short song, rhyme or movement activity linked to I Am A Wonderful And Unique Creation. Use concrete objects and picture cards to gain attention.', '[{"id": "216e6eef-56f2-414e-948f-17f7a0d1a132", "phase": "TEACHER-LED ACTIVITY", "description": "Show and model I Am A Wonderful And Unique Creation  ... (583 characters truncated) ... ask for I Am A Wonderful And Unique Creation with the teacher\'s encouragement.", "duration_minutes": 8, "resources": [], "source": "deterministic"}]', '[{"id": "132a8670-3d03-45d1-aa90-829ad8bb70be", "phase": "LEARNER", "description": "Take an active part in the activity for I Am A Wonderful And Uniq ... (440 characters truncated) ... onderful And Unique Creation on your own and check your work before you finish.", "duration_minutes": 8, "resources": [], "source": "deterministic"}]', '[{"id": "c99a794c-ea53-4c10-ad50-2af61a84838a", "phase": "TEACHER", "description": "Facilitate the activity and keep every learner focused on I Am A  ... (505 characters truncated) ... and note learners who need re-teaching of I Am A Wonderful And Unique Creation.", "duration_minutes": 8, "resources": [], "source": "deterministic"}]', 'Observe children during play and the individual try, using a simple checklist for I Am A Wonderful And Unique Creation. Note who needs more practice; there is no written test. Assessment mode: Oral questions and observation of participation.', "Gather the children, sing or clap about I Am A Wonderful And Unique Creation, and praise specific efforts. Pack away together. Preview the next lesson ('The Parts Of The Human Body (Both External And Internal) And Their').", '[]', '[]', '[]', '', 'Support: Give extra one-to-one help and larger, simpler materials so the child can try I Am A Wonderful And Unique Creation successfully.\nExtension: ... (36 characters truncated) ...  harder version or let them show a friend how to do I Am A Wonderful And Unique Creation.\nGrouping: Whole-group circle time, then small play groups.', '[]', 'generated', 0, 0, '{}', '2026-09-26 22:45:58.759990', '2026-09-26 22:45:58.759998')
