ish.", "duration_minutes": 8, "resources": [], "source": "deterministic"}]', '[{"id": "c99a794c-ea53-4c10-ad50-2af61a84838a", "phase": "TEACHER", "description": "Facilitate the activity and keep every learner focused on I Am A  ... (505 characters truncated) ... and note learners who need re-teaching of I Am A Wonderful And Unique Creation.", "duration_minutes": 8, "resources": [], "source": "deterministic"}]', 'Observe children during play and the individual try, using a simple checklist for I Am A Wonderful And Unique Creation. Note who needs more practice; there is no written test. Assessment mode: Oral questions and observation of participation.', "Gather the children, sing or clap about I Am A Wonderful And Unique Creation, and praise specific efforts. Pack away together. Preview the next lesson ('The Parts Of The Human Body (Both External And Internal) And Their').", '[]', '[]', '[]', '', 'Support: Give extra one-to-one help and larger, simpler materials so the child can try I Am A Wonderful And Unique Creation successfully.\nExtension: ... (36 characters truncated) ...  harder version or let them show a friend how to do I Am A Wonderful And Unique Creation.\nGrouping: Whole-group circle time, then small play groups.', '[]', 'generated', 0, 0, '{}', '2026-09-26 22:45:58.759990', '2026-09-26 22:45:58.759998')
