2026-09-26 22:46:25,936 INFO sqlalchemy.engine.Engine [cached since 57.72s ago] ('c7500648-958f-48d7-975a-f2ef06b13f27', '5c124428-8c66-4f43-b0b7-cd32d3f3fa57', 'f970b1d6-965d-47b1-a811-9e639c8e3501', 'f08dbed6-a661-405c-8619-d49f464b0a99', None, 1, '2026-09-11', 0, 2, 1, 1, '2026-09-14', 1, '', 'KG 1', 'Numeracy', 11, 60, '', 'KG Acceptance Teacher', 'All About Me', 'I am a wonderful and unique\ncreation', 'K1.1.1.1', 'K1.1.1.1', '["K1.1.1.1.1 K1.1.1.1.1-7"]', '["K1.1.1.1.1"]', 'All About Me - I am a wonderful and unique\ncreation', "Learners' everyday experience related to this activity.", '[{"id": "5009821c-6b5f-4950-a37f-b1096e3dcc00", "description": "Learners can identify, talk about and act out I am a wonderful and unique\\ncreation", "indicator_code": "K1.1.1.1.1", "source": "deterministic"}]', 'Learners will recognize and appreciate the beauty, order, and purpose of design in the physical world around them.', 'Shaping our world.', '["God worshiper", "Image reflector"]', 'Creation', '', '[]', '["counters", "cut-outs", "mirrors", "crayons", "big books", "Posters"]', '[]', '["counters", "cut-outs", "mirrors", "crayons", "big books", "Posters"]', 'This lesson focuses on I am a wonderful and unique\ncreation within All About Me - I am a wonderful and unique\ncreation.', 'Begin with a short song, rhyme or movement activity linked to I am a wonderful and unique\ncreation. Use concrete objects and picture cards to gain attention.', '[{"id": "2b104187-a7f6-4a96-a4ae-e5686b8e3167", "phase": "TEACHER-LED ACTIVITY", "description": "Show and model I am a wonderful and unique\\ncreatio ... (589 characters truncated) ... k for I am a wonderful and unique\\ncreation with the teacher\'s encouragement.", "duration_minutes": 8, "resources": [], "source": "deterministic"}]', '[{"id": "c1a83b79-02f1-4aba-a5c1-f030d74e5713", "phase": "LEARNER", "description": "Take an active part in the activity for I am a wonderful and uniq ... (446 characters truncated) ... derful and unique\\ncreation on your own and check your work before you finish.", "duration_minutes": 8, "resources": [], "source": "deterministic"}]', '[{"id": "4ca25a55-5bf7-4b06-9768-d8ad063e8dd3", "phase": "TEACHER", "description": "Facilitate the activity and keep every learner focused on I am a  ... (511 characters truncated) ... d note learners who need re-teaching of I am a wonderful and unique\\ncreation.", "duration_minutes": 8, "resources": [], "source": "deterministic"}]', 'Observe children during play and the individual try, using a simple checklist for I am a wonderful and unique\ncreation. Note who needs more practice; there is no written test. Assessment mode: Oral questions and observation of participation.', "Gather the children, sing or clap about I am a wonderful and unique\ncreation, and praise specific efforts. Pack away together. Preview the next lesson ('The parts of the human body\nand their functions').", '[]', '[]', '[]', '', 'Support: Give extra one-to-one help and larger, simpler materials so the child can try I am a wonderful and unique\ncreation successfully.\nExtension ... (38 characters truncated) ... harder version or let them show a friend how to do I am a wonderful and unique\ncreation.\nGrouping: Whole-group circle time, then small play groups.', '[]', 'generated', 0, 0, '{}', '2026-09-26 22:46:25.936319', '2026-09-26 22:46:25.936328')
