2026-09-26 22:46:25,987 INFO sqlalchemy.engine.Engine [cached since 57.77s ago] ('eb8ec661-45ed-4afb-8a57-51eed6a8ded6', '5c124428-8c66-4f43-b0b7-cd32d3f3fa57', 'f970b1d6-965d-47b1-a811-9e639c8e3501', 'f08dbed6-a661-405c-8619-d49f464b0a99', None, 4, '2026-10-02', 0, 12, 1, 4, '2026-09-14', 1, '', 'KG 1', 'Numeracy', 11, 60, '', 'KG Acceptance Teacher', 'All About Me', 'Keeping my body healthy by\neating good food and getting\nvaccinated', 'K1.1.4.1', 'K1.1.4.1', '["K1.1.4.1.1 K1.1.4.1.1-4"]', '["K1.1.4.1.1"]', 'All About Me - Keeping my body healthy by\neating good food and getting\nvaccinated', 'Previous lesson: Caring for the parts of my\nbody', '[{"id": "8c9a3906-cc66-4410-8f08-e44754b4172e", "description": "Learners can identify, talk about and act out Keeping my body healthy by\\neating good food and getting\\nvaccinated", "indicator_code": "K1.1.4.1.1", "source": "deterministic"}]', 'Learners will recognize and appreciate the beauty, order, and purpose of design in the physical world around them.', 'Shaping our world.', '["God worshiper", "Image reflector"]', 'Creation', '', '[]', '["Healthy-food pictures", "vaccination chart", "real foods"]', '[]', '["Healthy-food pictures", "vaccination chart", "real foods"]', "This lesson builds on 'Caring for the parts of my\nbody' and moves the class on to Keeping my body healthy by\neating good food and getting\nvaccinated.", "Build on the previous lesson ('Caring for the parts of my\nbody'). Begin with a short song, rhyme or movement activity linked to Keeping my body healthy by\neating good food and getting\nvaccinated. Use concrete objects and picture cards to gain attention.", '[{"id": "8a5e3981-4255-43c4-8234-a3907b36908d", "phase": "TEACHER-LED ACTIVITY", "description": "Show and model Keeping my body healthy by\\neating g ... (685 characters truncated) ... \\neating good food and getting\\nvaccinated with the teacher\'s encouragement.", "duration_minutes": 8, "resources": [], "source": "deterministic"}]', '[{"id": "7f8b137e-98db-4aef-b222-31381cf54600", "phase": "LEARNER", "description": "Take an active part in the activity for Keeping my body healthy b ... (542 characters truncated) ... ood and getting\\nvaccinated on your own and check your work before you finish.", "duration_minutes": 8, "resources": [], "source": "deterministic"}]', '[{"id": "5d8afa33-d9ef-4c0c-b0b7-a22dae454813", "phase": "TEACHER", "description": "Facilitate the activity and keep every learner focused on Keeping ... (607 characters truncated) ... hing of Keeping my body healthy by\\neating good food and getting\\nvaccinated.", "duration_minutes": 8, "resources": [], "source": "deterministic"}]', 'Observe children during play and the individual try, using a simple checklist for Keeping my body healthy by\neating good food and getting\nvaccinated. Note who needs more practice; there is no written test. Assessment mode: Oral questions and observation of participation.', "Gather the children, sing or clap about Keeping my body healthy by\neating good food and getting\nvaccinated, and praise specific efforts. Pack away together. Preview the next lesson ('Keeping my body healthy by\neating good food and taking\nmy vaccination').", '[]', '[]', '[]', '', 'Support: Give extra one-to-one help and larger, simpler materials so the child can try Keeping my body healthy by\neating good food and getting\nvacc ... (100 characters truncated) ...  a friend how to do Keeping my body healthy by\neating good food and getting\nvaccinated.\nGrouping: Whole-group circle time, then small play groups.', '[]', 'generated', 0, 0, '{}', '2026-09-26 22:46:25.986661', '2026-09-26 22:46:25.986667')
