g good food and taking\\nmy vaccination with the teacher\'s encouragement.", "duration_minutes": 8, "resources": [], "source": "deterministic"}]', '[{"id": "f766384a-be8f-4074-bc62-e66a7786f442", "phase": "LEARNER", "description": "Take an active part in the activity for Keeping my body healthy b ... (551 characters truncated) ...  and taking\\nmy vaccination on your own and check your work before you finish.", "duration_minutes": 8, "resources": [], "source": "deterministic"}]', '[{"id": "1a154249-27f2-45b6-805d-8e92b4c7d1f2", "phase": "TEACHER", "description": "Facilitate the activity and keep every learner focused on Keeping ... (616 characters truncated) ... g of Keeping my body healthy by\\neating good food and taking\\nmy vaccination.", "duration_minutes": 8, "resources": [], "source": "deterministic"}]', 'Observe children during play and the individual try, using a simple checklist for Keeping my body healthy by\neating good food and taking\nmy vaccination. Note who needs more practice; there is no written test. Assessment mode: Oral questions and observation of participation.', 'Gather the children, sing or clap about Keeping my body healthy by\neating good food and taking\nmy vaccination, and praise specific efforts. Pack away together.', '[]', '[]', '[]', '', 'Support: Give extra one-to-one help and larger, simpler materials so the child can try Keeping my body healthy by\neating good food and taking\nmy va ... (106 characters truncated) ... friend how to do Keeping my body healthy by\neating good food and taking\nmy vaccination.\nGrouping: Whole-group circle time, then small play groups.', '[]', 'generated', 0, 0, '{}', '2026-09-26 22:46:26.002725', '2026-09-26 22:46:26.002737')
