hat al ... (474 characters truncated) ... lay at Sorting and matching, encourage them by name and praise their attempts.", "duration_minutes": 12, "resources": [], "source": "deterministic"}]', 'Watch each child during the activity and ask simple oral questions — point to, name or show Sorting and matching. Tick who can do it and who needs mo ... (20 characters truncated) ...  written test. Assessment mode: Classification exercise with accuracy check. Evidence: each child shows or names one example of Sorting and matching.', 'Bring the children back to the circle, sing or clap about Sorting and matching, let a few children show what they made or did, and praise each child.', '[]', '[]', '[]', '', 'Support: Sit beside the child, guide the hand or the answer for Sorting and matching, and use bigger, simpler objects until the child succeeds.\nExte ... (30 characters truncated) ...  early do Sorting and matching again with more objects or show a friend how it is done.\nGrouping: Whole-class circle time, then small guided groups.', '[]', 'generated', 0, 0, '{}', '2026-09-26 22:46:42.941185', '2026-09-26 22:46:42.941190')
