2026-09-26 22:46:42,952 INFO sqlalchemy.engine.Engine [cached since 74.73s ago] ('b474ad96-7dfe-41f7-9a59-0c808484a7af', '676c5367-2c7b-40ee-ae1a-f5e6fa667fee', '59db2165-590e-41b4-89a7-d13183f5f6d6', '984a30ba-f24c-4e34-aff4-956e05a2b7e7', None, 5, '2026-10-24', 1, 5, 0, 4, '2026-09-14', 1, '', 'Nursery 1', 'Numeracy', 11, 60, '', 'Nursery Acceptance Teacher', 'Number', 'Pairing', '', '', '[]', '[]', 'Number - Pairing', "Learners' everyday experience related to this activity.", '[{"id": "1d073059-ed14-4c49-82b7-ed585c14fc83", "description": "Learners can show and talk about Pairing", "indicator_code": null, "source": "deterministic"}]', 'Learners will recognize and appreciate the beauty, order, and purpose of design in the physical world around them.', 'Shaping our world.', '["God worshiper", "Image reflector"]', 'Creation', '', '[]', '["flash cards", "Counters", "sticks"]', '[]', '["flash cards", "Counters", "sticks"]', 'This lesson focuses on Pairing within Number - Pairing.', 'Gather the children with a familiar song or rhyme, then show the real objects or pictures for Pairing and let them touch and talk about them.', '[{"id": "5b21a7d2-a562-44c6-be2e-7fb03cc295f8", "phase": "TEACHER MODELLING", "description": "Model Pairing slowly with real objects while the childr ... (531 characters truncated) ... ng, matching, singing or colouring \\u2014 while you watch and encourage them.", "duration_minutes": 12, "resources": [], "source": "deterministic"}]', '[{"id": "e7be4b48-bad1-4179-ad5e-6a583c25ed5e", "phase": "LEARNER", "description": "Watch and listen carefully, then describe each step of Pairing in ... (395 characters truncated) ... ", "description": "Join in the play or song about Pairing and try it yourself.", "duration_minutes": 12, "resources": [], "source": "deterministic"}]', '[{"id": "2aeffbc3-69d8-45e0-80bf-e0dcefca0447", "phase": "TEACHER", "description": "Model Pairing slowly, think aloud, and check that all learners ca ... (435 characters truncated) ... ren as they play at Pairing, encourage them by name and praise their attempts.", "duration_minutes": 12, "resources": [], "source": "deterministic"}]', 'Watch each child during the activity and ask simple oral questions — point to, name or show Pairing. Tick who can do it and who needs more help; there is no written test. Assessment mode: Oral questions and observation of participation. Evidence: each child shows or names one example of Pairing.', "Bring the children back to the circle, sing or clap about Pairing, let a few children show what they made or did, and praise each child. Preview the next lesson ('Pairing').", '[]', '[]', '[]', '', 'Support: Sit beside the child, guide the hand or the answer for Pairing, and use bigger, simpler objects until the child succeeds.\nExtension: Let ch ... (4 characters truncated) ... en who finish early do Pairing again with more objects or show a friend how it is done.\nGrouping: Whole-class circle time, then small guided groups.', '[]', 'generated', 0, 0, '{}', '2026-09-26 22:46:42.951788', '2026-09-26 22:46:42.951795')
