2026-09-26 22:46:42,980 INFO sqlalchemy.engine.Engine [cached since 74.76s ago] ('8049093e-91b6-4378-aacb-065873502fe2', '676c5367-2c7b-40ee-ae1a-f5e6fa667fee', '59db2165-590e-41b4-89a7-d13183f5f6d6', '984a30ba-f24c-4e34-aff4-956e05a2b7e7', None, 7, '2026-11-07', 1, 7, 0, 6, '2026-09-14', 1, '', 'Nursery 1', 'Numeracy', 11, 60, '', 'Nursery Acceptance Teacher', 'Number', 'Tolerance', '', '', '[]', '[]', 'Number - Tolerance', "Learners' everyday experience related to this activity.", '[{"id": "58fae593-c41e-49f1-929d-ce84958d8450", "description": "Learners can show and talk about Tolerance", "indicator_code": null, "source": "deterministic"}]', 'Learners will recognize and appreciate the beauty, order, and purpose of design in the physical world around them.', 'Shaping our world.', '["God worshiper", "Image reflector"]', 'Creation', '', '[]', '["flash cards", "Counters", "sticks"]', '[]', '["flash cards", "Counters", "sticks"]', 'This lesson focuses on Tolerance within Number - Tolerance.', 'Gather the children with a familiar song or rhyme, then show the real objects or pictures for Tolerance and let them touch and talk about them.', '[{"id": "07ed7477-8c75-4ff5-9b07-84ddcae471da", "phase": "TEACHER MODELLING", "description": "Model Tolerance slowly with real objects while the chil ... (537 characters truncated) ... ng, matching, singing or colouring \\u2014 while you watch and encourage them.", "duration_minutes": 12, "resources": [], "source": "deterministic"}]', '[{"id": "07256628-ceed-4bec-83b3-cfe872a2c2ba", "phase": "LEARNER", "description": "Watch and listen carefully, then describe each step of Tolerance  ... (401 characters truncated) ...  "description": "Join in the play or song about Tolerance and try it yourself.", "duration_minutes": 12, "resources": [], "source": "deterministic"}]', '[{"id": "9994e636-9dd4-40a9-a9ef-5a459c713392", "phase": "TEACHER", "description": "Model Tolerance slowly, think aloud, and check that all learners  ... (441 characters truncated) ... n as they play at Tolerance, encourage them by name and praise their attempts.", "duration_minutes": 12, "resources": [], "source": "deterministic"}]', 'Watch each child during the activity and ask simple oral questions — point to, name or show Tolerance. Tick who can do it and who needs more help; th ... (2 characters truncated) ... e is no written test. Assessment mode: Oral questions and observation of participation. Evidence: each child shows or names one example of Tolerance.', 'Bring the children back to the circle, sing or clap about Tolerance, let a few children show what they made or did, and praise each child.', '[]', '[]', '[]', '', 'Support: Sit beside the child, guide the hand or the answer for Tolerance, and use bigger, simpler objects until the child succeeds.\nExtension: Let  ... (8 characters truncated) ...  who finish early do Tolerance again with more objects or show a friend how it is done.\nGrouping: Whole-class circle time, then small guided groups.', '[]', 'generated', 0, 0, '{}', '2026-09-26 22:46:42.979999', '2026-09-26 22:46:42.980006')
