2026-09-26 22:46:43,014 INFO sqlalchemy.engine.Engine [cached since 74.79s ago] ('bb50ca62-1767-4e35-b24e-265d9f203250', '676c5367-2c7b-40ee-ae1a-f5e6fa667fee', '59db2165-590e-41b4-89a7-d13183f5f6d6', '984a30ba-f24c-4e34-aff4-956e05a2b7e7', None, 10, '2026-11-28', 1, 10, 0, 9, '2026-09-14', 1, '', 'Nursery 1', 'Numeracy', 11, 60, '', 'Nursery Acceptance Teacher', 'Number', 'Tracing', '', '', '[]', '[]', 'Number - Tracing', "Learners' everyday experience related to this activity.", '[{"id": "6e3816b6-fc1c-4db2-8f31-592e41c83d3c", "description": "Learners can show and talk about Tracing", "indicator_code": null, "source": "deterministic"}]', 'Learners will recognize and appreciate the beauty, order, and purpose of design in the physical world around them.', 'Shaping our world.', '["God worshiper", "Image reflector"]', 'Creation', '', '[]', '["Colours"]', '[]', '["Colours"]', 'This lesson focuses on Tracing within Number - Tracing.', 'Gather the children with a familiar song or rhyme, then show the real objects or pictures for Tracing and let them touch and talk about them.', '[{"id": "81def7bb-3c2b-4ffc-9cdb-9ba11eec243c", "phase": "TEACHER MODELLING", "description": "Model Tracing slowly with real objects while the childr ... (531 characters truncated) ... ng, matching, singing or colouring \\u2014 while you watch and encourage them.", "duration_minutes": 12, "resources": [], "source": "deterministic"}]', '[{"id": "c3ccda3e-b635-41f4-8db3-5b324b063143", "phase": "LEARNER", "description": "Watch and listen carefully, then describe each step of Tracing in ... (395 characters truncated) ... ", "description": "Join in the play or song about Tracing and try it yourself.", "duration_minutes": 12, "resources": [], "source": "deterministic"}]', '[{"id": "4c77865e-9422-409d-82d1-5b5ef77cfa6f", "phase": "TEACHER", "description": "Model Tracing slowly, think aloud, and check that all learners ca ... (435 characters truncated) ... ren as they play at Tracing, encourage them by name and praise their attempts.", "duration_minutes": 12, "resources": [], "source": "deterministic"}]', 'Watch each child during the activity and ask simple oral questions — point to, name or show Tracing. Tick who can do it and who needs more help; there is no written test. Assessment mode: Oral questions and observation of participation. Evidence: each child shows or names one example of Tracing.', 'Bring the children back to the circle, sing or clap about Tracing, let a few children show what they made or did, and praise each child.', '[]', '[]', '[]', '', 'Support: Sit beside the child, guide the hand or the answer for Tracing, and use bigger, simpler objects until the child succeeds.\nExtension: Let ch ... (4 characters truncated) ... en who finish early do Tracing again with more objects or show a friend how it is done.\nGrouping: Whole-class circle time, then small guided groups.', '[]', 'generated', 0, 0, '{}', '2026-09-26 22:46:43.014600', '2026-09-26 22:46:43.014606')
