arking simple rules slowly, think aloud, and check that al ... (474 characters truncated) ... lay at Marking simple rules, encourage them by name and praise their attempts.", "duration_minutes": 12, "resources": [], "source": "deterministic"}]', 'Watch each child during the activity and ask simple oral questions — point to, name or show Marking simple rules. Tick who can do it and who needs mo ... (24 characters truncated) ... tten test. Assessment mode: Oral questions and observation of participation. Evidence: each child shows or names one example of Marking simple rules.', "Bring the children back to the circle, sing or clap about Marking simple rules, let a few children show what they made or did, and praise each child. Preview the next lesson ('Marking simple rules').", '[]', '[]', '[]', '', 'Support: Sit beside the child, guide the hand or the answer for Marking simple rules, and use bigger, simpler objects until the child succeeds.\nExte ... (30 characters truncated) ...  early do Marking simple rules again with more objects or show a friend how it is done.\nGrouping: Whole-class circle time, then small guided groups.', '[]', 'generated', 0, 0, '{}', '2026-09-26 22:47:40.105356', '2026-09-26 22:47:40.105367')
