 activities and try it yourself.", "duration_minutes": 12, "resources": [], "source": "deterministic"}]', '[{"id": "06b38e7e-49a2-44da-987a-6644cd448d5a", "phase": "TEACHER", "description": "Model Obeying rules during creative activities slowly, think alou ... (534 characters truncated) ...  during creative activities, encourage them by name and praise their attempts.", "duration_minutes": 12, "resources": [], "source": "deterministic"}]', 'Watch each child during the activity and ask simple oral questions — point to, name or show Obeying rules during creative activities. Tick who can do ... (64 characters truncated) ... t mode: Oral questions and observation of participation. Evidence: each child shows or names one example of Obeying rules during creative activities.', 'Bring the children back to the circle, sing or clap about Obeying rules during creative activities, let a few children show what they made or did, and praise each child.', '[]', '[]', '[]', '', 'Support: Sit beside the child, guide the hand or the answer for Obeying rules during creative activities, and use bigger, simpler objects until the c ... (70 characters truncated) ... les during creative activities again with more objects or show a friend how it is done.\nGrouping: Whole-class circle time, then small guided groups.', '[]', 'generated', 0, 0, '{}', '2026-09-26 22:47:40.151287', '2026-09-26 22:47:40.151299')
