": "deterministic"}]', '[{"id": "03d65cd7-e8cf-410d-a1a3-edeb164f116a", "phase": "TEACHER", "description": "Model Unplanned / uncontrolled (scribbling) slowly, think aloud,  ... (525 characters truncated) ... / uncontrolled (scribbling), encourage them by name and praise their attempts.", "duration_minutes": 12, "resources": [], "source": "deterministic"}]', 'Watch each child during the activity and ask simple oral questions — point to, name or show Unplanned / uncontrolled (scribbling). Tick who can do it ... (56 characters truncated) ... ssment mode: Product or performance assessment with rubric. Evidence: each child shows or names one example of Unplanned / uncontrolled (scribbling).', "Bring the children back to the circle, sing or clap about Unplanned / uncontrolled (scribbling), let a few children show what they made or did, and praise each child. Preview the next lesson ('Unplanned / uncontrolled (scribbling)').", '[]', '[]', '[]', '', 'Support: Sit beside the child, guide the hand or the answer for Unplanned / uncontrolled (scribbling), and use bigger, simpler objects until the chil ... (64 characters truncated) ... ed / uncontrolled (scribbling) again with more objects or show a friend how it is done.\nGrouping: Whole-class circle time, then small guided groups.', '[]', 'generated', 0, 0, '{}', '2026-09-26 22:47:40.171966', '2026-09-26 22:47:40.171979')
