2026-09-26 22:47:40,205 INFO sqlalchemy.engine.Engine [cached since 132s ago] ('cd720013-32d1-4d2d-afc8-38392daa4227', 'c981705b-95e0-4091-9022-3cd7f72094e2', 'b3e66aa8-8e38-423d-83e7-3a163c020389', 'c1771adc-41ad-4ac1-b80b-d38d29862255', None, 8, '2026-11-14', 1, 8, 0, 7, '2026-09-14', 1, '', 'Nursery 1', 'Creative Arts and Design', 11, 60, '', 'Nursery Acceptance Teacher', 'Drawing and Colouring', 'Colouring', '', '', '[]', '[]', 'Drawing and Colouring - Colouring', "Learners' everyday experience related to this activity.", '[{"id": "84577a40-2d61-4a51-bd10-6edbc5224132", "description": "Learners can show and talk about Colouring", "indicator_code": null, "source": "deterministic"}]', 'Learners will recognize and appreciate the beauty, order, and purpose of design in the physical world around them.', 'Shaping our world.', '["God worshiper", "Image reflector"]', 'Creation', '', '[]', '["Charts & Pictures"]', '[]', '["Charts & Pictures"]', 'This lesson focuses on Colouring within Drawing and Colouring - Colouring.', 'Gather the children with a familiar song or rhyme, then show the real objects or pictures for Colouring and let them touch and talk about them.', '[{"id": "5abad91c-4033-4d0c-8070-d175953f04cf", "phase": "TEACHER MODELLING", "description": "Model Colouring slowly with real objects while the chil ... (537 characters truncated) ... ng, matching, singing or colouring \\u2014 while you watch and encourage them.", "duration_minutes": 12, "resources": [], "source": "deterministic"}]', '[{"id": "248a926a-ed03-489c-a98f-96460049cb42", "phase": "LEARNER", "description": "Watch and listen carefully, then describe each step of Colouring  ... (401 characters truncated) ...  "description": "Join in the play or song about Colouring and try it yourself.", "duration_minutes": 12, "resources": [], "source": "deterministic"}]', '[{"id": "69b341ef-55da-45ff-a06d-d47d4897035e", "phase": "TEACHER", "description": "Model Colouring slowly, think aloud, and check that all learners  ... (441 characters truncated) ... n as they play at Colouring, encourage them by name and praise their attempts.", "duration_minutes": 12, "resources": [], "source": "deterministic"}]', 'Watch each child during the activity and ask simple oral questions — point to, name or show Colouring. Tick who can do it and who needs more help; th ... (2 characters truncated) ... e is no written test. Assessment mode: Oral questions and observation of participation. Evidence: each child shows or names one example of Colouring.', "Bring the children back to the circle, sing or clap about Colouring, let a few children show what they made or did, and praise each child. Preview the next lesson ('Colouring').", '[]', '[]', '[]', '', 'Support: Sit beside the child, guide the hand or the answer for Colouring, and use bigger, simpler objects until the child succeeds.\nExtension: Let  ... (8 characters truncated) ...  who finish early do Colouring again with more objects or show a friend how it is done.\nGrouping: Whole-class circle time, then small guided groups.', '[]', 'generated', 0, 0, '{}', '2026-09-26 22:47:40.204367', '2026-09-26 22:47:40.204417')
