fter scribbling and try it yourself.", "duration_minutes": 12, "resources": [], "source": "deterministic"}]', '[{"id": "602533bb-a28d-4583-9898-e5ae2b9a9818", "phase": "TEACHER", "description": "Model Making naming / talk about picture after scribbling slowly, ... (567 characters truncated) ... ut picture after scribbling, encourage them by name and praise their attempts.", "duration_minutes": 12, "resources": [], "source": "deterministic"}]', 'Watch each child during the activity and ask simple oral questions — point to, name or show Making naming / talk about picture after scribbling. Tick ... (86 characters truncated) ... l questions and observation of participation. Evidence: each child shows or names one example of Making naming / talk about picture after scribbling.', "Bring the children back to the circle, sing or clap about Making naming / talk about picture after scribbling, let a few children show what they made or did, and praise each child. Preview the next lesson ('Making naming / talk about picture after scribbling').", '[]', '[]', '[]', '', 'Support: Sit beside the child, guide the hand or the answer for Making naming / talk about picture after scribbling, and use bigger, simpler objects  ... (92 characters truncated) ... about picture after scribbling again with more objects or show a friend how it is done.\nGrouping: Whole-class circle time, then small guided groups.', '[]', 'generated', 0, 0, '{}', '2026-09-26 22:47:40.257032', '2026-09-26 22:47:40.257044')
