2026-09-26 22:48:08,705 INFO sqlalchemy.engine.Engine [cached since 160.5s ago] ('7c33f8c2-bedc-4511-aa38-2a94bc9fc53f', '1b998261-7db5-4914-a912-cc4be0dd1898', '41f42795-bda3-4b1c-ae19-8743a0c5a39a', 'e3268d1b-4c4e-4b2e-aa86-6ddf664af840', None, 4, '2026-10-17', 1, 4, 0, 3, '2026-09-14', 1, '', 'Nursery 1', 'Our World Our People', 11, 60, '', 'Nursery Acceptance Teacher', 'Plants', 'Kinds of plants in the environment', '', '', '[]', '[]', 'Plants - Kinds of plants in the environment', "Learners' everyday experience related to this activity.", '[{"id": "aca6ffee-d0b2-4190-acfe-13e867516162", "description": "Learners can show and talk about Kinds of plants in the environment", "indicator_code": null, "source": "deterministic"}]', 'Learners will recognize and appreciate the beauty, order, and purpose of design in the physical world around them.', 'Shaping our world.', '["God worshiper", "Image reflector"]', 'Creation', '', '[]', '["Charts & Pictures"]', '[]', '["Charts & Pictures"]', 'This lesson focuses on Kinds of plants in the environment within Plants - Kinds of plants in the environment.', 'Gather the children with a familiar song or rhyme, then show the real objects or pictures for Kinds of plants in the environment and let them touch and talk about them. Watch for: Confusing plant processes or organism roles.', '[{"id": "595058b1-ae9c-4e2a-a86e-656bb57fd601", "phase": "TEACHER MODELLING", "description": "Model Kinds of plants in the environment slowly with re ... (612 characters truncated) ... ng, matching, singing or colouring \\u2014 while you watch and encourage them.", "duration_minutes": 12, "resources": [], "source": "deterministic"}]', '[{"id": "18d75a50-cf75-4362-b350-16a48b01684e", "phase": "LEARNER", "description": "Watch and listen carefully, then describe each step of Kinds of p ... (476 characters truncated) ... the play or song about Kinds of plants in the environment and try it yourself.", "duration_minutes": 12, "resources": [], "source": "deterministic"}]', '[{"id": "9ef603a1-126e-482a-88f0-8b26028fc619", "phase": "TEACHER", "description": "Model Kinds of plants in the environment slowly, think aloud, and ... (516 characters truncated) ... f plants in the environment, encourage them by name and praise their attempts.", "duration_minutes": 12, "resources": [], "source": "deterministic"}]', 'Watch each child during the activity and ask simple oral questions — point to, name or show Kinds of plants in the environment. Tick who can do it an ... (50 characters truncated) ... ssessment mode: Product or performance assessment with rubric. Evidence: each child shows or names one example of Kinds of plants in the environment.', "Bring the children back to the circle, sing or clap about Kinds of plants in the environment, let a few children show what they made or did, and praise each child. Preview the next lesson ('Kinds of plants in the environment').", '[]', '[]', '[]', '', 'Support: Sit beside the child, guide the hand or the answer for Kinds of plants in the environment, and use bigger, simpler objects until the child s ... (58 characters truncated) ... s of plants in the environment again with more objects or show a friend how it is done.\nGrouping: Whole-class circle time, then small guided groups.', '[]', 'generated', 0, 0, '{}', '2026-09-26 22:48:08.705096', '2026-09-26 22:48:08.705107')
