CHER", "description": "Model Parts of plants slowly, think aloud, and check that all lea ... (459 characters truncated) ... hey play at Parts of plants, encourage them by name and praise their attempts.", "duration_minutes": 12, "resources": [], "source": "deterministic"}]', 'Watch each child during the activity and ask simple oral questions — point to, name or show Parts of plants. Tick who can do it and who needs more he ... (12 characters truncated) ...  no written test. Assessment mode: Product or performance assessment with rubric. Evidence: each child shows or names one example of Parts of plants.', 'Bring the children back to the circle, sing or clap about Parts of plants, let a few children show what they made or did, and praise each child.', '[]', '[]', '[]', '', 'Support: Sit beside the child, guide the hand or the answer for Parts of plants, and use bigger, simpler objects until the child succeeds.\nExtension ... (20 characters truncated) ... inish early do Parts of plants again with more objects or show a friend how it is done.\nGrouping: Whole-class circle time, then small guided groups.', '[]', 'generated', 0, 0, '{}', '2026-09-26 22:48:08.749437', '2026-09-26 22:48:08.749449')
