ource": "deterministic"}]', '[{"id": "2674921e-5910-4132-a709-d2c3d0c1f843", "phase": "TEACHER", "description": "Model The role of members in the family slowly, think aloud, and  ... (513 characters truncated) ... le of members in the family, encourage them by name and praise their attempts.", "duration_minutes": 12, "resources": [], "source": "deterministic"}]', 'Watch each child during the activity and ask simple oral questions — point to, name or show The role of members in the family. Tick who can do it and ... (50 characters truncated) ... sessment mode: Oral questions and observation of participation. Evidence: each child shows or names one example of The role of members in the family.', 'Bring the children back to the circle, sing or clap about The role of members in the family, let a few children show what they made or did, and praise each child.', '[]', '[]', '[]', '', 'Support: Sit beside the child, guide the hand or the answer for The role of members in the family, and use bigger, simpler objects until the child su ... (56 characters truncated) ...  role of members in the family again with more objects or show a friend how it is done.\nGrouping: Whole-class circle time, then small guided groups.', '[]', 'generated', 0, 0, '{}', '2026-09-26 22:48:08.794967', '2026-09-26 22:48:08.794978')
